<v Michelle>She has just last names.

00:02:17.170 --> 00:02:22.800
<v Orlando>Brazilians typically give you your first name, your given
name, and then you have two last names, maternal and paternal.

00:02:22.850 --> 00:02:24.000
<v Valdo>And paternal, exactly.

00:02:24.850 --> 00:02:29.290
<v Orlando>In my case, for example, my full name is Orlando René Kelm.

00:02:29.450 --> 00:02:30.440
<v Orlando>René is my middle name.

00:02:30.490 --> 00:02:34.707
<v Orlando>And I don't go by two last names,
