00:03:48.780 --> 00:03:50.300
<v Orlando>They don't.

00:03:50.350 --> 00:03:53.750
<v Orlando>There is no way to say "have eaten".
They just say, "you already ate"?

00:03:53.800 --> 00:03:54.400
